{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52178","headline":"颂六十二首 三 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牧（一作「没」）杖信爲急，调弦贵不奢。\n腾猨安可制，逸马本难罝。\n驱驰习声色，冠盖竞豪华。\n既入王孙第，还向季伦家。\n静心澄业累，省念勖身瑕。\n庶兹凭七觉（一作「宝」），时用免三邪。\n（见同书同卷《摄念部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}